      "sample_index": 2,
      "text": "To determine how many minutes it will take to print 200 pages given that the printer prints 17 pages per minute, we can use the following steps:\n\n1. **Identify the rate of printing**: The printer prints 17 pages per minute.\n2. **Determine the total number of pages to be printed**: We need to print 200 pages.\n3. **Calculate the time required**: We need to find out how many minutes it takes to print 200 pages at a rate of 17 pages per minute. This can be done by dividing the total number of pages by the rate of printing.\n\nThe calculation is as follows:\n\\[\n\\text{Time required} = \\frac{\\text{Total number of pages}}{\\text{Rate of printing}} = \\frac{200 \\text{ pages}}{17 \\text{ pages per minute}}\n\\]\n\nFirst, perform the division:\n\\[\n\\frac{200}{17} \\approx 11.7647\n\\]\n\nSince we need the time to the nearest whole number, we round 11.7647 to the nearest whole number, which is 12.\n\nTherefore, the time required to print 200 pages is \\boxed{12} minutes.",
